  <tag k="access" v="yes"/>
  <tag k="description" v="The stone was once to be seen built into the front wall of a two-storey house, erected in 1825. It was the Parish Watch House. Its purpose was to hold ‘the drunk and disorderly. Believed to be demolished between the First and Second World Wars."/>
